          #BPSGroupForConsecutiveWZWTerms.num_defn
            %h6#definition_11 Definition
            %p
              By this proposition it is consistent to ask for a
              %em consecutive
              definitite globalization of two consecutive WZW term
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
