                    \\,.
          %p
            By cor.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#KSExtensionForHeis"}
            this is an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-group+extension"} ∞-group extension
            of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
