          %h3#M5BraneChargesInAnM2BraneCondensate Example: M5-brane charges in an M2-brane condensate
          #M5ChargeExtensions.num_example
            %h6#example_7 Example
            %p
              Consider again
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi H
