              denotes the “
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity+Lie+6-algebra"}> supergravity Lie 6-algebra
              ”. Both hooks
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
